----------------------------------------------------------------------
Runtime dependencies: NONE.

The SDK uses only the platform's native `fetch`, `ReadableStream`,
`TextDecoder`, and `crypto.randomUUID` — every supported runtime
(Node 18+, modern browsers, Cloudflare Workers, Deno, Bun) provides
these on the global scope.

Development-only dependencies (TypeScript, tsup, vitest, ESLint,
typescript-eslint, openapi-typescript, size-limit, @types/node) ship
under their respective open-source licenses; see each project's
distribution for the exact terms.
